  "label": "本地实机运行",
  "src": "本地实测：npx cds watch + curl（@sap/cds 9.9.3）",
  "caption": "一次请求的往返证据：HTTP → OData 解析 → 认证 → handler → 数据库 → 响应，服务端同步打印所在阶段",
  "lh": 19,
  "lines": [
    "$ curl -u alice:alice -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\\n' \\",
    "    \"http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/book-order/BookOrders?\\$top=2\"",
    "200",
    "$ curl -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\\n' \"http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/book-order/BookOrders\"   # 匿名",
    "401",
    "$ curl -s -u alice:alice \"http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/book-order/getOrderTotal(orderNo='BO-1003')\"",
    "17400",
    "$ curl -s -u alice:alice -X POST \\",
    "    \"http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/book-order/BookOrders(ID=...,IsActiveEntity=true)/submitOrder\" -d '{}'",
    "\"订单 BO-1001 已提交，合计 16000.00 JPY（3 行）\"",
    "",
    "# 同时看服务端（cds watch 的那个窗口）：",
    "[odata] - GET /odata/v4/book-order/BookOrders { '$top': '2' }",
    "[odata] - GET /odata/v4/book-order/getOrderTotal(orderNo='BO-1003')",
    "[odata] - POST /odata/v4/book-order/BookOrders(ID=...,IsActiveEntity=true)/submitOrder",
    "",
    "# 请求顺序：OData 解析 → 认证(401/403 在此) → before → on/bound action → 数据库 → after → 响应",
    "# 自定义 handler 里 req.reject(400/404/409) 直接变成 HTTP 状态码，见第 ⑤⑥⑦ 章"
  ],
